#. module: backstage
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:backstage.view_backstage_backend_form
msgid ""
"<strong>Disabled.</strong> Backstage is not sending anything to Magento.\n"
"                        Test the connection, map the sources and set up the pickup stores, then enable it."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Desactivat.</strong> Backstage no envia res a Magento. Prova la "
"connexió, assigna les fonts i configura les botigues de recollida, i després"
" activa'l."

#. module: backstage
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:backstage.view_backstage_backend_form
msgid ""
"<strong>Enabled, stealth mode ON.</strong> Everything is sent to Magento, but customers receive\n"
"                        no e-mail about their orders. Work a few orders as usual and check that <em>To review</em>\n"
"                        stays empty before notifying customers."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Activat, stealth mode ON.</strong> S'envia tot a Magento, però els "
"clients no reben cap correu sobre les seves comandes. Gestiona unes quantes "
"comandes com de costum i comprova que <em>Per revisar</em> es manté buit "
"abans d'avisar els clients."

#. module: backstage
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:backstage.view_backstage_backend_form
msgid ""
"<strong>Enabled.</strong> Everything is sent to Magento, and customers receive\n"
"                        Magento e-mails about their orders."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Activat.</strong> S'envia tot a Magento, i els clients reben els "
"correus de Magento sobre les seves comandes."

